	rything\, and we wouldn’t watch it anywhere else but here with you. \nKick
	off is at 2:00 p.m. Admission is free! \nCommunity Partners: Further enhan
	cing programming\, Levy Park will partner with local organizations to broa
	den community engagement\, including collaborations with cultural groups a
	nd soccer-focused nonprofits. Levy Park is seeking enthusiastic volunteers
	 and community partner organizations to help bring this festival to life. 
	Volunteers will work directly alongside our event team\, supporting booth 
	operations and helping ensure every guest has an unforgettable experience.
	 Email us to learn more about volunteer opportunities. \nFood and Beverage
	 Concessions: Enjoy a variety of festival food fare\, beer and wine\, and 
	non-alcoholic beverages from Coca-Cola. \nMerchandise: Event merchandise c
	elebrating Houston\, Levy Park\, and the global soccer tournament will als
	o be available for purchase. \nArt Installations and Photo Opportunities: 
	Commemorate the experience with a photo tour of the park\, including life-
	sized soccer-themed photo backdrops and a tournament bracket. Visit our so
	ccer ball music box and turn the crank for festive sounds.\n\nhttps://www.
	levyparkhouston.org/events/semifinals-2/\n\nFrom Levy Park Houston
